config BR2_PACKAGE_NVIDIA_OOT
	bool "nvidia-oot kernel modules"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  NVIDIA's out-of-tree kernel modules for Jetson (nvidia-oot
	  core + nvgpu + hwpm) from the L4T r39.2 public_sources
	  release, built against the system kernel. Provides the GPU
	  device (/dev/nvgpu/igpu0) that the CUDA userland drives.

	  Display modules are not built (headless system).

	  EXPERIMENTAL: see docs/m4-cuda.md; the module set and any
	  in-tree driver replacements are still being validated.
